sode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:44.38,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:00:00.36,0:00:02.19,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This sucks...Dialogue: 50,0:00:02.19,0:00:04.69,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,My body... It's burning up.Dialogue: 50,0:00:05.48,0:00:08.24,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess... I'm still alive.Dialogue: 50,0:00:08.24,0:00:11.99,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,But... for how much longer...?Dialogue: 50,0:00:24.55,0:00:26.67,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no one here.Dialogue: 50,0:00:26.67,0:00:28.92,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,An abandoned ship, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:00:29.55,0:00:32.18,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Scrap wood... Scrap iron...Dialogue: 50,0:00:33.60,0:00:37.85,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This place makes me feel... right at home.Dialogue: 50,0:00:38.39,0:00:43.61,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,First things first, I've gotta do something... about this useless body!Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.68,0:02:37.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.89,0:02:43.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom's violent apprentice, Cutty Flam, is dead.Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.19,0:02:48.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was hit by the sea train.Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.82,0:02:51.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg...Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.86,0:02:54.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you can do it.Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.07,0:02:58.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom was the world's greatest shipwright, and you were his finest apprentice.Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.12,0:03:01.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can do it...Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.16,0:03:03.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure...Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.37,0:03:06.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Miss Kokoro, let's grab a drink one of these days...Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.25,0:03:09.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll blow off some steam.Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.09,0:03:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.72,0:03:15.09,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Tom...Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.09,0:03:17.26,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,please watch me.Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.76,0:03:20.26,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll carry on your will.Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.68,0:03:22.22,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to protect...Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.89,0:03:24.18,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,everything!Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.85,0:03:26.19,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This town...Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.64,0:03:28.48,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,and these blueprints as well!Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.03,0:03:35.36,Main-207+,,0,0,12,,Mr. Iceburg, you have a guest.Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.36,0:03:38.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said you would know him if I mentioned "Cutty Flam."Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.78,0:03:40.03,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky?Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.91,0:03:43.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shall I show him in?Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.00,0:03:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No.Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.91,0:03:47.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn him away.Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.25,0:03:56.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got a roundabout  way of meeting people.Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.05,0:04:01.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well... anyway, what's up with that strange-looking body?Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.97,0:04:03.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Put a sock in it!Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.10,0:04:07.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My body was totaled, so I had to rebuild it with scrap metal to survive!Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.27,0:04:08.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More importantly,Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.06,0:04:12.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard your company's been building ships for the World Government!Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.61,0:04:15.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna keep quiet while you help those bastards!Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.99,0:04:17.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After they took Mr. Tom and–Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.95,0:04:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten who made the weapons that caused that incident?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.79,0:04:28.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you have a lot of things that you want to say to me...Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.96,0:04:33.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but don't think that I've forgiven you in the past four years.Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.25,0:04:34.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After what happened,Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.84,0:04:37.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you have the nerve to show your face!Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.67,0:04:38.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.84,0:04:42.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was certain you were dead.Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.35,0:04:44.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what the government reported.Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.56,0:04:47.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Tom might have forgiven you,Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.02,0:04:50.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I'll never be able to!Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.44,0:04:59.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, what the hell?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.36,0:05:03.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aren't these the blueprints we saw for that ancient weapon?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.49,0:05:07.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't use the name Cutty Flam ever again.Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.91,0:05:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since the government couldn't get them from Mr. Tom,Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.46,0:05:13.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's only a matter of time before they come for me.Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.54,0:05:16.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take them and leave the island, Franky.Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.38,0:05:17.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave the island?Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.84,0:05:20.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam from Tom's Workers is dead.Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.68,0:05:24.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as you don't use that name, they can't connect us.Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.76,0:05:29.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave the island with those blueprints and their trail goes cold for good.Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.85,0:05:33.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on a sec! What happens when they show up and you've got zilch?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.40,0:05:36.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've said my piece.Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Iceburg!Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.53,0:05:40.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This may be farewell.Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.03,0:05:41.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.28,0:05:45.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna end up like Mr. Tom?Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.41,0:05:47.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep the blueprints with you!Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.29,0:05:50.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If your life is in danger, you can just hand 'em over!Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.83,0:05:54.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell, if that's not an option, torch 'em right in front of their faces!Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.96,0:05:57.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you were me, would you do that?Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.09,0:06:00.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Tom achieved so much,Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.84,0:06:03.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and he threw it all away to protect those blueprints.Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.18,0:06:09.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there's even the slightest risk that Nico Robin can revive the ancient weapon,Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.85,0:06:13.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the world needs those blueprints to fight back.Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.02,0:06:16.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if I continue to keep them with me...Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.86,0:06:20.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd sooner die... than hand the government those blueprints!Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.94,0:06:22.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure about this?Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.65,0:06:25.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I might build the thing.Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.03,0:06:27.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you really trust me?Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.28,0:06:30.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doesn't my giving them to you answer that question?Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.58,0:06:33.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We never change, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.66,0:06:36.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We yell at each other whenever we meet.Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.00,0:06:38.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I still won't forgive you...Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.88,0:06:41.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and maybe you feel the same way, but...Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.55,0:06:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky...Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.63,0:06:44.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm...Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.93,0:06:46.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,really...Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.01,0:06:50.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,glad...Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.39,0:06:51.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're alive.Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.90,0:07:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Dumburg!Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.07,0:07:05.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving this island!Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.03,0:07:07.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I do what I want!Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.41,0:07:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I would never do what you tell me to, even if it kills me!Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.53,0:07:11.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never!Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.58,0:07:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flunky, you moron!Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.21,0:07:26.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We heard Tom was indeed a skilled shipwright,Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.63,0:07:31.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he was also a dangerous, unruly fishman with monstrous strength.Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.51,0:07:34.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When we asked around, the townspeople only gave vague answers.Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.98,0:07:38.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must be tough as an apprentice to defend such a man.Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.40,0:07:40.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, Cutty Flam?Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.44,0:07:43.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm too tired to take that bait.Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.28,0:07:46.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You government agents are all trash!Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.40,0:07:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Hey, hey...Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.82,0:07:51.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Back then, over 100 citizens, including marines and officials,Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.83,0:07:54.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,were severely injured here in Water Seven.Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.00,0:07:57.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The culprit behind it was you.Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.29,0:08:01.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You had committed a grave crime against the World Government,Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.25,0:08:05.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but since you were confirmed dead in the sea train accident on that very day,Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.84,0:08:08.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,no charges could be pressed.Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.55,0:08:13.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But now, we'll finally take you to Enies Lobby as a criminal.Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.51,0:08:16.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can take your time there answering our questions...Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.60,0:08:21.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,about the whereabouts of the blueprints for Pluton.Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.06,0:08:23.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blueno.Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.07,0:08:26.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It just connected.Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.32,0:08:35.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When we reported this case to our chief, he wished to speak with you immediately.Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.83,0:08:37.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your chief?Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.04,0:08:40.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please go ahead, Chief.Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.58,0:08:41.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.75,0:08:45.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hot! It's hot! It's hot! I spilled my coffee!Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.34,0:08:48.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Stupid coffee!Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.22,0:08:50.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck?Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.22,0:08:52.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you there...Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.22,0:08:54.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam?Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.81,0:08:58.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.60,0:09:01.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never imagined you had survived...Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.73,0:09:07.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe, but I'm happy to hear it.Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.23,0:09:10.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These past eight years, every time my scars hurt,Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.49,0:09:15.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was tormented by an anger that I couldn't take out on anyone...Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.54,0:09:21.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because the criminal who disfigured me croaked.Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.25,0:09:24.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.25,0:09:27.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't remember me?Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.17,0:09:35.14,Main-207+,,0,0,15,,I'm the man from Cipher Pol No. 5 who personally apprehended Tom's WorkersDialogue: 50,0:09:35.14,0:09:38.77,Main-207+,,0,0,15,,for attacking the judicial ship eight years ago!Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.77,0:09:43.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard! Spanda!Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.15,0:09:45.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With an "m"! It's "Spandam" with an "m"!Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.23,0:09:51.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be very much looking forward to your arrival at Enies Lobby.Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.82,0:09:53.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, men!Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.28,0:09:57.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quit dillydallying and bring that criminal here already!Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.96,0:10:02.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouch! It's hot! It's hot! It's hot!Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.79,0:10:04.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid lamp!Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.33,0:10:06.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger.Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.46,0:10:09.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...!Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.46,0:10:13.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Let me go, you jackass!Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.09,0:10:14.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's move.Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.69,0:10:26.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not another step, scumbags!Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.98,0:10:29.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drop him, now!Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.45,0:10:35.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My apologies.Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.12,0:10:38.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Is that swagger just for show?Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.12,0:10:44.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If memory serves, you're one of the Straw Hats, correct?Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.54,0:10:47.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.96,0:10:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't working! The wind is too strong!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.47,0:10:54.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not going out!Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.97,0:10:57.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyone inside will be done for if this keeps up!Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.74,0:11:16.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Iceburg!Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.20,0:11:17.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Paulie!Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.46,0:11:26.12,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami...!Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.12,0:11:27.25,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This is bad...Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.75,0:11:29.92,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to...Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.92,0:11:31.25,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,treat her...Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.25,0:11:33.59,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,right... away...Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.97,0:11:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Treat them immediately! Those burns are serious!Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.48,0:11:47.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about this reindeer?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.69,0:11:49.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Him, too! He saved their lives!Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.98,0:11:55.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-You're right. Hey! Give me a hand!Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.40,0:11:58.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, man.Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.20,0:12:04.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He got his ass kicked.Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.71,0:12:11.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, in short, you're no longer part of the Straw Hats,Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.50,0:12:14.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but you're still a dastardly pirate, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.42,0:12:17.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In that case, we'll apprehend you as well.Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.80,0:12:18.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa!Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.59,0:12:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger.Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.14,0:12:24.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As for this ship...Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.23,0:12:28.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you haven't scrapped it yet?Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.77,0:12:31.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch it! Don't you dare lay a finger on her!Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.03,0:12:43.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.28,0:12:45.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.29,0:12:51.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Although our professions were a cover, we're still accomplished shipwrights.Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.46,0:13:00.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When we tell you a ship is no good, you should pipe down and listen.Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.09,0:13:06.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what?! Just leave her alone! She's not even your ship!Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.60,0:13:08.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This lets out the water, right?Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.93,0:13:12.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't do anything stupid! Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.49,0:13:25.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop it!Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.13,0:13:41.97,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.97,0:13:44.89,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll carry you guys for a little bit longer.Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.15,0:14:06.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Merry!Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.04,0:14:17.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back! It's gonna collapse!Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.00,0:14:20.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.59,0:14:22.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run, dumbass!Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.89,0:14:31.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Isn't there anything we can do?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.65,0:14:41.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Iceburg has regained consciousness!Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.53,0:14:43.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?! That's amazing!Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.36,0:14:46.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a relief! He's okay!Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.87,0:14:48.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Iceburg!Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.70,0:14:50.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to that reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.45,0:14:53.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But... I heard he's the Straw Hats' pet.Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.46,0:14:59.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! This one, too!Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.84,0:15:01.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The woman woke up!Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.09,0:15:09.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What now? Should we make her cough up the Straw Hats' whereabouts?Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.05,0:15:12.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It feels weird to interrogate an injured lady.Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.06,0:15:13.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's–Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.44,0:15:16.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Iceburg, you shouldn't be up!Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.40,0:15:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys...Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.90,0:15:23.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,give us some room.Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.24,0:15:27.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want to talk to this woman alone.Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.96,0:15:41.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What could the two of them be talking about?Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.34,0:15:42.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beats me.Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.67,0:15:44.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow! What'd you do that for?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.63,0:15:46.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quit standing around!Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.63,0:15:49.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Lucci and the others could still be inside!Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.14,0:15:51.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give us a hand, you idiots!Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.01,0:15:54.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right. C'mon!Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.14,0:15:55.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, our bad!Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.52,0:15:59.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well...Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.27,0:16:03.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, I must apologize.Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.65,0:16:07.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We falsely accused you of a crime. I'll set the record straight later.Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.57,0:16:12.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want to talk about Nico Robin.Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.62,0:16:15.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you know something?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.29,0:16:19.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did she start acting strange upon your arrival to this town?Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.54,0:16:21.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was very abrupt.Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.71,0:16:24.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right after we got to town, she suddenly disappeared.Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.67,0:16:30.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By this morning, she was already the suspect of your attempted assassination.Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.18,0:16:33.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When our crew finally tracked her down...Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.43,0:16:36.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,she told us she wouldn't be returning.Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.23,0:16:39.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We didn't understand what was happening,Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.60,0:16:45.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we came here tonight to ask her once more why she's leaving the ship.Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.57,0:16:48.82,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,To make my wish come true...Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.70,0:16:53.41,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,A wish that can never come true if I stay with you...Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.24,0:16:58.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this wish that can't come true if she stays?Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.67,0:17:01.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what I know.Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.63,0:17:10.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was probably when you lost sight of Nico Robin the first time.Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.68,0:17:12.68,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm with CP9.Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.68,0:17:15.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The government's operation was already in progress.Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.89,0:17:22.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is, of course, a reason for that woman's actions.Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.77,0:17:25.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But... before I tell you that,Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.52,0:17:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you should know that both Nico Robin and I have a means to revive an ancient weaponDialogue: 50,0:17:30.15,0:17:31.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that could destroy the world.Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.82,0:17:33.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Destroy the world?Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.28,0:17:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.45,0:17:41.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our plan hit a snag.Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.00,0:17:43.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone, come to the bedroom immediately.Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.33,0:17:45.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot Iceburg yet.Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.51,0:17:51.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You get it now, Nico Robin?Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.26,0:17:54.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The blueprints you guys were after are fakes.Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.85,0:18:02.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if it gets me killed, I won't give those blueprints to the government!Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.85,0:18:08.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if you're sniffing around the poneglyphs and helping the government,Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.19,0:18:12.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then I have to stop you right here, right now!Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.28,0:18:18.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not seeking the poneglyphs in order to bring the weapon back.Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.16,0:18:19.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just...Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.29,0:18:20.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,want to know the history.Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.96,0:18:23.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's no excuse!Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.38,0:18:28.05,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you.Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.71,0:18:31.21,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Again and again...Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.76,0:18:34.68,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Whether you intend harm or not,Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.14,0:18:37.35,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,weapons don't care who they hurt...Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.35,0:18:41.73,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,even if it's someone you love!Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.68,0:18:47.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That which hurts people doesn't necessarily have malicious intent.Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.02,0:18:53.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If your simple curiosity about the history of the world would lead to its destruction,Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.07,0:18:55.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you should die here and now, Nico Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.49,0:19:01.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You still wish to pursue that history after seeing what befell those devils of Ohara?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.46,0:19:05.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what would you know about Ohara?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.79,0:19:09.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have no idea...Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.17,0:19:12.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,how much the World Government has ruined my life!Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.05,0:19:16.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you hate them so much, why are you helping them?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.72,0:19:22.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because no matter the cost, I have a wish I must fulfill.Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.19,0:19:34.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There were two conditions that CP9 forced on me in this town.Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.57,0:19:39.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The first was to pin your assassination on the Straw Hats.Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.08,0:19:45.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The second was to surrender myself to the government and obey all their orders.Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.46,0:19:48.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you do that, you'll die, too.Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.50,0:19:53.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After running for twenty years, why take a deal like that now?Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.72,0:19:56.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On this single occasion,Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.72,0:20:02.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,CP9 has been given authorization to exercise a buster call against the Straw Hats.Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.39,0:20:03.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A buster call?Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.18,0:20:07.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a priority call to Marine HeadquartersDialogue: 50,0:20:07.44,0:20:11.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to send five vice admirals and ten battleships to one place.Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.32,0:20:16.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once you're the target of such overwhelming military might,Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.07,0:20:18.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's absolutely zero chance of survival.Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.45,0:20:23.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This authority is normally held by the three admiralsDialogue: 50,0:20:23.99,0:20:27.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the fleet admiral at the head of the Marines.Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.37,0:20:30.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But this time,Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.00,0:20:33.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,thanks to Admiral Aokiji,Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.30,0:20:36.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,CP9 was authorized to utilize it just this once.Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.47,0:20:41.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't cooperated, a buster call would have befallen us.Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.72,0:20:45.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As soon as I heard the name Aokiji, I gave up.Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.64,0:20:47.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These last twenty years,Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.89,0:20:53.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never had an issue running away because I had nothing to protect...Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.02,0:20:56.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because I could betray others and use them as my shield.Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.86,0:20:58.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But now...Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.36,0:21:01.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't just abandon them.Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.78,0:21:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The life I once discarded...Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.75,0:21:08.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The heart that I lost...Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.41,0:21:13.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The dreams I thought were dead... They kept bringing them back to me.Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.88,0:21:16.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I found friends...Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.30,0:21:18.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who truly believe in me.Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.01,0:21:22.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then...Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.09,0:21:23.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,what is your wish?Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.39,0:21:32.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That the six Straw Hat pirates, excluding myself, be allowed to leave the island safely!Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.56,0:21:37.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'd revive the weapon for that?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.07,0:21:39.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't care what happens to the world?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.99,0:21:41.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't!Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.41,0:21:44.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough of this nonsense!Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.50,0:21:54.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I couldn't pull the trigger.Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.68,0:22:03.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of all the people...Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.30,0:22:06.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over the lives of everyone in this world...Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.93,0:22:09.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She chose to save the six of you.Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.60,0:22:12.23,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,It was for us...Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.31,0:22:17.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that they'll likely steal the weapon's blueprints anyway,Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.11,0:22:19.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't have much room to talk, I guess.Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.08,0:22:27.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's wrong?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.33,0:22:32.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a relief...Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.67,0:22:35.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So Robin...Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.13,0:22:37.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,didn't betray us after all!Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.30,0:22:44.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got to get everyone together pronto and let them know! Thanks, Mr. Iceburg!Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.34,0:22:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on! You were all beaten soundly!Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.10,0:22:48.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you think you can do now?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.97,0:22:50.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.06,0:22:52.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It starts now!Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.39,0:22:56.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the others are fine. It'll take more than that to keep them down.Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.52,0:22:59.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're going to get Robin back!Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.02,0:23:01.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,People waver when faced with uncertainty.Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.32,0:23:08.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once they know she needs help, they won't stop until she's safe!Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.12,0:23:13.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.71,0:23:14.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:23:15.79,0:23:18.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Wake up! We have to find everyone!Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.63,0:23:20.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Hey, wake up!Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.21,0:23:22.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hey, hey, he's seriously injured... – Hey, hey, he's seriously injured...Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.71,0:23:25.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.84,0:23:28.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper...Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.18,0:23:32.81,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Go join Luffy and the others and tell them everything that just happened.Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.81,0:23:34.94,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't leave out a single word.Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.94,0:23:36.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What about you?Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.81,0:23:39.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll part ways here for a bit.Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.31,0:23:42.65,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, don't worry. I won't do anything reckless.Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.24,0:23:48.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.82,0:23:50.70,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think...Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.70,0:23:52.78,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin hates us now?Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.66,0:23:56.79,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper...Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.00,0:24:01.21,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Remember this one thing:Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.21,0:24:05.63,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,When a woman lies...Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.43,0:24:09.34,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,a real man forgives her.Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.10,0:24:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,22,,For the final train to Enies Lobby departing at eleven,Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.60,0:24:23.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,please board from the second floor lobby due to the raised water level.Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.11,0:24:25.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's sneak a peak!Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.24,0:24:25.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.74,0:24:34.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since this involves a secret operation, you're prohibited from seeing who boards.Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.62,0:24:35.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Rats! – Rats!Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.04,0:24:46.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've been pursuing you for twenty years.Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.05,0:24:48.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you finally gave up.Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.65,0:25:02.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bingo.Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:33.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Four Years LaterDialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:33.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Four Years LaterDialogue: 0,0:07:17.46,0:07:23.21,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,BingoDialogue: 1,0:07:17.46,0:07:23.21,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,BingoDialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:09:02.73,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Command Center Enies LobbyDialogue: 1,0:08:55.85,0:09:02.73,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Command Center Enies LobbyDialogue: 1,0:08:55.85,0:09:02.73,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Command Center Enies LobbyDialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:38.77,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief Spandam Cipher Pol No. 9Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.26,0:09:38.77,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief Spandam Cipher Pol No. 9Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.26,0:09:38.77,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief Spandam Cipher Pol No. 9Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:54.47,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Headquarters Galley-La CompanyDialogue: 1,0:10:48.3